{"text": "Tenancy abstract — Apt 12, The Maltings, Bridge Street\nPrepared by Declan Heffernan, Corrib Lettings Ltd, for the landlord's solicitor. Our ref CL/GAL/0338. Dated 04/11/2025.\nParties\nRole\tName\tContact\tPPSN\nLandlord\tSorcha Ní Fhlannagáin\tsorcha.nif@iarthar.example, 087 555 0144\t7284519TA\nTenant 1\tTomasz Wieczorek\tt.wieczorek@postoffice.example, +353 85 555 0190\t3391057LW\nTenant 2\tAna-Luísa Figueiredo\t085 555 0161\t4410882F\nAgent\tCorrib Lettings\t091 555 0120\t—\n\nPremises\nApt 12, The Maltings, Bridge Street, Galway, H91 XK2P. Two-bed, second floor, BER C2. The landlord's own address for notices is Teach na Mara, An Spidéal, Co. na Gaillimhe, H91 F6W3.\nKey terms\n• Tenancy began 1 September 2023; fixed term to 31 August 2024, now a Part 4 tenancy under the Residential Tenancies Act 2004.\n• RTB registration no. RT-0923-118703. The property is in a Rent Pressure Zone.\n• Rent €1,850 per month, reviewed to €1,887.00 from 01/09/2025 (2% cap). Deposit held: €1,850.\n• Rent is paid by standing order on the 1st to the landlord's account at Lough Atalia Credit Union: IBAN IE23 AIBK 3657 8015 7702 51, BIC LACUIE2GXXX.\n• Of the monthly rent, €1,100 comes direct from the council because the tenants receive HAP (HAP ref. GCC-HAP-0044172); the tenants pay the remaining €787 themselves.\nCurrent position\n• Ms Ní Fhlannagáin wishes to sell and has asked whether a notice of termination can be served. Length of tenancy is over two years, so the notice period is 180 days at least.\n• Arrears: the tenants' top-up was missed for August and October 2025; balance owing €1,574.00. Mr Wieczorek says he was laid off from the medical device plant in Parkmore in July and has asked for a payment plan of €150 a month.\n• Ana-Luísa is expecting a baby in January; Sorcha knows this and does not want it referred to in any notice.\n• Inspection of 22 October: no damage; smoke alarm in hall replaced.", "kind": "Rich Text document", "detail": "314 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Declan Heffernan", "Sorcha Ní Fhlannagáin", "Tomasz Wieczorek", "Ana-Luísa Figueiredo"], "companies": ["Corrib Lettings Ltd", "Corrib Lettings", "Postoffice"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Apt 12", "The Maltings", "Bridge Street", "Galway", "H91 XK2P", "Teach na Mara", "An Spidéal", "Co. na Gaillimhe"], "health": ["medical device plant", "baby"], "sensitive": ["Sorcha Ní Fhlannagáin", "Tomasz Wieczorek", "Ana-Luísa Figueiredo"], "names": ["Declan", "Sorcha", "Tomasz", "Ana-Luísa"]}, "chunks": 1, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.7000000029802322, "modelMs": 14891.39999999851, "topicMs": 22581.30000000447, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 19, "end": 25, "text": "Apt 12", "kind": "places", "source": "model", "canonical": "Apt 12"}, {"start": 27, "end": 39, "text": "The Maltings", "kind": "places", "source": "model", "canonical": "The Maltings"}, {"start": 41, "end": 54, "text": "Bridge Street", "kind": "places", "source": "model", "canonical": "Bridge Street"}, {"start": 67, "end": 83, "text": "Declan Heffernan", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Declan Heffernan"}, {"start": 85, "end": 104, "text": "Corrib Lettings Ltd", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Corrib Lettings Ltd"}, {"start": 144, "end": 155, "text": "CL/GAL/0338", "kind": "record", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "CL/GAL/0338"}, {"start": 163, "end": 173, "text": "04/11/2025", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "04/11/2025"}, {"start": 215, "end": 236, "text": "Sorcha Ní Fhlannagáin", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Sorcha Ní Fhlannagáin"}, {"start": 237, "end": 263, "text": "sorcha.nif@iarthar.example", "